OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers' emotion at Remembrance
OL,4,Apoppy response
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's much, much bigger than we thought
OL,7,Fit was going to be when we started,"
OL,8,FEccleston said, after putting together
OL,9,Fthe display on Sunday. "We've just
OL,10,Fstood back and gone, 'woah'.
